{'symbol': 'LYB', 'date': '2021-05-28 05:30:00', 'title': 'LYONDELLBASELL ANNOUNCES 7.6 PERCENT INCREASE TO QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "HOUSTON AND LONDON, MAY 28, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LYONDELLBASELL (NYSE: LYB), ONE OF THE LARGEST PLASTICS, CHEMICALS AND REFINING COMPANIES IN THE WORLD, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $1.13 PER SHARE, REPRESENTING A 7.6 PERCENT INCREASE OVER THE COMPANY'S FIRST QUARTER 2021 DIVIDEND. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID\xa0JUNE 14, 2021\xa0TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD\xa0JUNE 7, 2021, WITH AN EX-DIVIDEND DATE OF\xa0JUNE 4, 2021."}